    <string name="disclaimer_content"><![CDATA[
<p><b>1. Non-commercial open-source project:</b> This software is an open-source non-profit project maintained by an individual developer. It charges no fees and provides no commercial warranty or technical support of any kind.</p>
<p><b>2. Dependence on third-party services:</b> The built-in "free model" feature relies on API interfaces provided by third-party providers (such as OpenKilo, OpenCode Zen, etc.). Your conversation content will be transmitted to the third-party servers you select. The developer has no control over how these services process data, so please be cautious when entering personal or private information.</p>
<p><b>3. Content risk:</b> AI-generated content may contain errors, biases, or inappropriate information and does not represent the developer\'s views. Users are solely responsible for any consequences arising from their use of AI.</p>
<p><b>4. Service stability:</b> Free APIs are provided by third parties. Availability is not guaranteed 24/7, and the service may be interrupted or rate-limited at any time due to upstream policy changes.</p>
<p><b>5. Declaration updates:</b> The developer reserves the right to update this disclaimer, and the updated version will be displayed within the application.</p>
<p><b>Last updated: 2026-07-31</b></p>
]]></string>

